last_updated:           2026-10-10
source_event:           libwmf/0.2.15 full wmf_api_create and SVG consumer; OHOS W3 libwmf-w3-20261004T074946Z upstream Automake 1/1 (51 converter invocations) and installed consumer 1/1; raw log SHA-256 80cf006f0d80b09b439ee8b2646b37b646dfb77af94686792d56220857444d16.
metrics_success_count:  1
metrics_fail_count:     0
metrics_confidence:     1.0
metrics_last_used:      2026-10-04
draft:                  true
contributor_id:         2501
ci_source_identity_increment: Full-API consumer success must bind the executed source identity, not raw equality of the disposable CI YAML. Official CI may expand a GitHub URL to its documented mirror list without changing tarball SHA or patch metadata; treating that transformation as arbitrary mutation rejects a valid full-API run, while ignoring all differences would admit genuine drift.
ci_source_identity_verification: Bind the frozen conandata bytes and .orig exactly, replay only the immutable official GitHub mirror-list transform, require its exact ordered bytes, and require all other recipe/test/patch inputs unchanged. Never commit the transformed disposable YAML or accept file URLs, changed hashes, added URLs or patch edits.
ci_tmpdir_evidence:     libwmf-w3-20261012-hmdfs-tmp-substep-r2 official W3 CI exit0, upstream check-examples1/1 with all51 converter invocations, installed full API consumer1/1, 12 phases and release PASS; log SHA256b181ba78c1159b15d3febff7e992df7070a32b0984646111a768c27e48938d8e. Two OHOS temporary-directory creation branches use private TMPDIR/umask007 mkdir; original cleanup/tests preserved.
ci_reproducibility_increment: A generated release configure can require canonicalizer data without requiring the Automake executable; sourcing helpers from ambient Automake makes an otherwise complete release fail before its full API and upstream suite can be exercised. Verify bundled helper provenance and canonicalize the compiler-proven native tuple locally instead.
ci_increment_scope:     Release tarballs containing generated configure/Makefile.in and modern config.sub; not Git snapshots requiring autoreconf or projects changing configure.ac/Makefile.am.
ci_increment_boundary:  Preserve the bundled helper before replacement, reject unexpected hash or compiler tuple, never invent a Linux build/host tuple, and leave non-OHOS source classification unchanged.
ci_increment_evidence:  PR14657 HEAD89184ca431863da6d7ad27bda93cccab8a6be912 CI80112 failed at automake executable missing; repaired candidate W3 libwmf-repair-w3-20261010T101340Z canonical aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos, upstream1/1 and installed full API consumer1/1, 12 receipt release validation PASS; raw log SHA2561d0b71e6e07518828eff74709358f63e5c7d2d92c186e472298072e65e4badbd.
